      "description": "Software Architect for Astra, providing data protection for stateful Kubernetes workloads on NetApp storage.\n\nIn my role as a software architect, I work with product management and customers to understand requirements for new features, refine those requirements into feasible high level designs, build experimental prototypes, and then lead agile dev teams to productize and deliver quality software. \n\nProjects I have led through this process include:\n- Re-architecture of Astra's core functionality from a monolithic service into a set of modular Kubernetes controllers driven by CRs.\n- AppMirror, a disaster recovery feature to orchestrate app replication between Kubernetes clusters, leveraging NetApp SnapMirror for volume replication between ONTAP clusters.\n- Support bundle generation and upload, to provide logs and metrics for the support team to help troubleshoot issues.",
